{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras/dd69c3b68ba04725b656ea62b75735a7.avif?t=1756489208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras_big/dd69c3b68ba04725b656ea62b75735a7.avif?t=1756489208 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Destiny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the full moon rises, the unrested ghosts who died on the battlefield appear again to seize the bodies of normal people for revenge or simply to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To protect the peace of everyone, each generation of Cube Ninja has to use \u201cPure Jade Shuriken\u201d to sever the grudge and send souls back to the underworld forever. But with each severing, the original owner of the body will die too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will our new Cube Ninja, who just took shuriken from his dying master, end everything? Or he\u2019s just another soul that also lost in slaughter, like those ghosts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ninja needs to resolve this battle as quickly as possible; he must find the origin of all this and then eliminate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras/b3bb2faed85c68e8624e3082b4f80805.avif?t=1756489208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras_big/b3bb2faed85c68e8624e3082b4f80805.avif?t=1756489208 width=800 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Moving Fast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ninja's fast movement skills come from the power of shuriken. The ninja first needs to throw the shuriken. After the shuriken is thrown, the ninja can immediately rush to the shuriken. The enemy hit by the shuriken will fall into a flaw, and the ninja's sprint can instantly kill the enemy who falls into the flaw. In addition, the ninja also masters karate. It will automatically kill or block any danger that is close enough. But once the shot is made, the ninja will fall into a flaw. After killing the enemy again, you can attack again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the level, the goal of the ninja is to kill enough enemies and reach the end. In the level, the ninja does not need to kill all the enemies, but only needs to find the fastest route in the vast sea of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras/2f12b6125504b2fc22300ed3671160ea.avif?t=1756489208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras_big/2f12b6125504b2fc22300ed3671160ea.avif?t=1756489208 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game highlights: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Move at super high speed, passing through the scene like flowing water. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Plan the route with enemies as nodes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Use terrain to fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Interesting mini-game levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Eat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras/22c2ce5d4762f580262cc23017f1eb29.avif?t=1756489208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810810/extras_big/22c2ce5d4762f580262cc23017f1eb29.avif?t=1756489208 width=800 height=350 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810810?t=1756489208","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg